    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Cannon How-to :\n--------------------------\n\n- To unpack the cannon : activate it on the ground.\n- To pack the cannon : click on the cannon and follow the conversation.\n- To recharge the cannon : unpack the cannon, click on it and follow the conversation. You need one explosive powder and one cannon balls pack to put 5 charges on the cannon.\n- To see how many charges the cannon still contains : click on the cannon and follow the conversation or activate the analyser on the cannon.\n\nThe cannon will try to hit the closest hostile ennemy. Non-hostile ennemies will not be targeted. If the ennemy is invisible, sanctuaried or hidden, the cannon will not target it."
